    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ushonephi othandiweyo wakho, wena muhlekazi kwabesifazane? uphi othandiweyo wakho? ukuze simfune kanye nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Othandiweyo wami wehlela ensimini yakhe, eziqholweni, ukuba adle emasimini, abuthe iminduze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mina ngingowothandiweyo wami, nothandiweyo wami ungowami; udla ngaphansi kweminduze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuhle, sithandwa sami, njengeTirisa, umuhle njengeJerusalema, wesabeka njengebutho eliphethe amabhanela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Susa amehlo akho kimi, ngokuba anginqobile; izinwele zakho zinjengomhlambi wezimbuzi ophuma kwaGileyadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazinyo akho anjengomhlambi wezimvu ezikhuphuka zigeziwe, zonke zizala amawele, kungekho neyodwa eyinyumba phakathi kwazo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengocezu lwepomegranati, amathempeli akho aphakathi kwezihluthulelo zakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukhona amakhosikazi angamashumi ayisithupha, nezancinza ezingamashumi ayisishiyagalombili nezintombi ezingenakubalwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Juba lami, opheleleyo wami munye; nguye yedwa kunina, okhethiweyo wakhe owamzalayo. Amadodakazi ambona futhi ambusisa; yebo, amakhosikazi nezancinza, bamdumisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngubani lo obonakala njengokusa, emuhle njengenyanga, ekhanya njengelanga, owesabekayo njengebutho eliphethe amabhanela?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "SNG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngehlela ensimini yamantongomane ukuze ngibone izithelo zasesigodini, ngibone ukuthi umvini uyakhama yini, namapomegranati ayakhama yini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "SNG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "SNG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
